    692  f2e9							; (Y sine +-6 inside spawn band, MothYDerive) and RAW candidate-col ==
    693  f2e9							; committed-col implies equal vl-cols (vl = f(Temp) deterministic; a raw
    694  f2e9							; mismatch at coarse edges only OVER-walks, never under-walks). Same-col
    695  f2e9							; candidate = the side the moth already arrived from = clear -> commit.
    696  f2e9							; Saves the prologue (~140c) + 5-rect loop (~340c) on every moth-run frame
    697  f2e9							; that stays in its column: measured +478c spikes inside UpdateEnemies.
